    "bbox": [
      58.58,
      725.08,
      538.61,
      788.74
    ],
    "text": "The sun is going to be directly over the latitudes of Sri Lanka during 28th of August to 07th of September due to its apparent southward relative motion. The nearest places of Sri Lanka over which the sun is overhead tomorrow (02) are Anamaduwa, Moragollagama, Dambulla, Manampitiya and Valaichchenai, about 12.10 noon.",
    "fonts": [
